  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Police Modernization Reform in Kazakhstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To respond existing security needs of the citizens and accelerate police transformation towards the establishment of people-oriented institution the Government of Kazakhstan has developed the Concept of Public Safety for 2024-2028. The Concept targets application of best practices, improvement of legislation, revision and streamlining of the existing business processes, introduction of new performance assessment system, greater citizens&#x2019; engagement in assessing effectiveness of police services.</narrative>
  </description>
